id: GQL-014
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: warn
title: Exposed introspection in production
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .py .rb .go
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: introspection
patterns:
  - regex: introspection:\s*true|enable_introspection\s*=\s*True
    message: "GraphQL introspection enabled — disable in production to prevent schema reconnaissance"
fix: Set introspection to false in production. Use environment checks — introspection: process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production'.
